  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helpdesk f&#xf6;r Handel och N&#xe4;ringslivssamverkan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helpdesk trade and private sector collaboration - Helpdesk trade and private sector collaboration- H&#xe5;llbar tillv&#xe4;xt 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helpdesken f&#xf6;r handel och samverkan med privat sektor ska tillhandah&#xe5;lla kortare konsulttj&#xe4;nster f&#xf6;r att ge  expertst&#xf6;d inom handel och n&#xe4;ringslivssamverkan i alla faser av Sidas insatshantering, portf&#xf6;lj och strategiarbete, fr&#xe4;mst men inte bara, inom verksamhetsomr&#xe5;de fattigdomsminskning genom jobbskapande och handel.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The help desk for trade and private sector collaboration aims to provide shorter consultancy services, hence expert support in the area of trade and private sector collaboration at all stages of the contribution management cycle. This includes but is not limited to the thematic area of poverty reduction, job creation and trade.</narrative>
  </description>
